playground genre. It's made by fans, for fans \u2014 celebrating what makes Gorilla Tag-inspired games fun while taking bold steps in new directions.\n\nGet ready to jump in, tag fast, and move free in the world of Azure Tag.", "short_description": "Azure Tag is a fast-paced fan game inspired by Gorilla Tag fan games. Leap, climb, and tag your way through stylized environments with unique movement mechanics \u2014 no legs, just skill and speed!"}]}, "developer_name": "VivoVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/azure-tag-privacy-policy?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "vivovr", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/azuretag?usp=sharing", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "24888368510816155"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491820047_1527546275246704_3496806752691471313_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=84jqjiaWJUkQ7kNvwHs0qZ8&_nc_oc=AdmlsGoPQ_Wswqb6LZRMcmmR1cCntf0lWXLEtPgj2QcKfn1DlGhlTh3VWtJkc4vSHbE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-hkg4-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsNIDzF7tZKxR3eW0ic80_DM43uuqyhjAxTbTjTjePBLg&oe=69A189B6"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Azure Tag", "platf